{
  "title": "Dimensional Formulas — Quick Reference Table",
  "notes": [
    "- **Area** — [L²]",
    "- **Volume** — [L³]",
    "- **Velocity** — [L T⁻¹]",
    "- **Acceleration** — [L T⁻²]",
    "- **Force** — [M L T⁻²]",
    "- **Work/Energy** — [M L² T⁻²]",
    "- **Power** — [M L² T⁻³]",
    "- **Pressure/Stress/Young's modulus** — [M L⁻¹ T⁻²]",
    "- **Momentum** — [M L T⁻¹]",
    "- **Impulse** — [M L T⁻¹]",
    "- **Torque** — [M L² T⁻²]",
    "- **Frequency** — [T⁻¹]",
    "- **Universal gravitational constant G** — [M⁻¹ L³ T⁻²]",
    "- **Plank's constant h** — [M L² T⁻¹]",
    "- **Surface tension** — [M T⁻²]",
    "- **Viscosity** — [M L⁻¹ T⁻¹]",
    "- **Note:** work and torque share [M L² T⁻²] — same dimensions, different meaning (a limitation of dimensional analysis)."
  ]
}